EmitChildModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Opens a new block by id and recursively lowers the child node (True/False/Body) via EmitSeq.
    Provides: EmitChild(blocks, id, node, childName, tail, counter) -> res.
    DependsOn: FindChild, NewOpen, EmitSeq (via merged namespace)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../EmitChild/EmitChild.sir).
